WEBVTT

00:07.040 --> 00:08.920
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:35.160 --> 01:38.920
‎ADAPTED FROM ‎JIA JIN CHAI‎, ORIGINAL NOVEL
‎BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:51.240 --> 01:52.640
She…

01:56.360 --> 01:58.440
She's an impostor.

02:07.760 --> 02:12.720
She's… Not the real one…

02:17.320 --> 02:18.680
Why isn't the physician here yet?

02:20.000 --> 02:21.000
Hurry!

02:22.520 --> 02:23.600
Not the real…

02:42.320 --> 02:45.520
Grandmother. You already knew the one at
the Duke's Residence wasn't the real one.

02:45.600 --> 02:46.680
This old woman's words were hardly needed.

02:46.760 --> 02:48.680
She made a grave mistake
at the Wei Residence

02:48.760 --> 02:51.720
and hoped the Zhou family
would take her in.

02:52.480 --> 02:54.040
To end up like this…

02:54.560 --> 02:55.800
She only has herself to blame.

03:11.160 --> 03:12.960
She is from the Earl
of Cheng'an's Residence, after all.

03:13.560 --> 03:16.760
Send for the Wei family
and have them take her away.

03:31.960 --> 03:33.200
Take her away.

03:43.720 --> 03:45.200
If you wanted to question her,

03:45.280 --> 03:46.560
you could've done it anywhere
at Xianzhuang.

03:46.640 --> 03:47.920
Why take her all the way to the rear hill,

03:48.000 --> 03:49.200
send the guards away,

03:49.280 --> 03:50.240
and question her alone?

03:50.840 --> 03:52.840
Unless this secret
has something to do with you.

03:53.640 --> 03:55.160
Nothing you've done tonight makes sense.

03:55.240 --> 03:57.520
-I shouldn't have indulged you.
-Yes!

03:58.320 --> 03:59.480
I did it.

04:09.560 --> 04:11.080
You know,

04:11.960 --> 04:15.160
my father abandoned his wife
and daughter to serve his country.

04:16.040 --> 04:19.000
My mother abandoned me for power and glory
at the palace.

04:19.720 --> 04:22.160
Then there's my grandmother,
obsessed with family's honor.

04:22.880 --> 04:26.320
They all got exactly what they wanted.

04:26.400 --> 04:28.000
Every one of them is selfish!

04:29.200 --> 04:31.480
Then why am I the one
expected to be selfless?

04:33.560 --> 04:34.440
Yes.

04:34.960 --> 04:38.160
I'm spoiled and willful.
I'm cruel to servants.

04:38.240 --> 04:39.840
I'm bad. I'm vicious.

04:39.920 --> 04:41.520
I've done every awful thing imaginable!

04:43.400 --> 04:44.760
But I'm scared.

04:45.600 --> 04:49.760
I'm scared she'll tell
Maternal Grandmother everything I've done

04:49.840 --> 04:51.000
and make you all hate me.

04:51.600 --> 04:53.200
I won't let that happen. I won't!

04:53.800 --> 04:55.880
-Rao, I…
-Don't you love me, Jue?

04:58.600 --> 05:00.720
Every year, the Huo family caravans

05:00.800 --> 05:02.640
bring treasures back
from the Western Regions.

05:03.440 --> 05:05.400
You always pick the finest ones for me.

05:06.640 --> 05:08.960
If you love someone, you put them first.

05:10.000 --> 05:12.520
You have to stand by me no matter what.

05:13.520 --> 05:15.640
Even if you're bad?

05:16.440 --> 05:17.760
Even if you're vicious?

05:22.880 --> 05:24.360
Even if I'm vicious.

05:25.080 --> 05:27.760
Even if I do terrible things,
you still have to help me.

05:29.560 --> 05:30.640
Huo Jue.

05:32.440 --> 05:33.800
I need you.

05:42.920 --> 05:46.320
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

05:47.400 --> 05:48.400
My Lady.

05:48.480 --> 05:50.800
Lady Li is watching your every move.

05:50.880 --> 05:52.320
You're already in danger yourself.

05:52.400 --> 05:54.640
How can you worry about those refugees?

05:55.440 --> 05:58.720
Why don't we have Liangcai quietly fetch
Madam Qiao and your sister,

05:58.800 --> 06:00.400
and hide them somewhere safe?

06:01.000 --> 06:02.520
That would keep you out of danger.

06:03.960 --> 06:08.160
Lady Li threatened me today
only to throw me off balance.

06:09.040 --> 06:11.320
If I send someone to hide Mother now,

06:12.280 --> 06:14.480
I'll only lead her straight to Mother.

06:16.240 --> 06:18.040
She hasn't made a move

06:18.560 --> 06:20.960
only because she fears
the Empress Dowager and the Lu family.

06:23.160 --> 06:27.280
Tell me,
why is everyone so afraid of Lady Li?

06:29.320 --> 06:31.800
Because she's
the Emperor's favorite consort.

06:32.320 --> 06:36.600
She has the Emperor's power behind her,
giving her status and authority.

06:37.280 --> 06:38.680
But now I have a title too.

06:39.280 --> 06:42.400
-But your title is…
-An empty title.

06:43.000 --> 06:46.120
It's prestigious in name only. Unless…

06:51.200 --> 06:52.400
Unless…

06:54.320 --> 06:56.880
I become a true thane with real power,

06:58.320 --> 07:01.600
with the people's support
and authority in my hands,

07:02.200 --> 07:04.280
with real power and prestige.

07:06.360 --> 07:09.960
Then what could a palace consort
possibly do against me?

07:10.880 --> 07:12.560
After all, the Empress Dowager
rules the palace,

07:13.160 --> 07:17.280
the court has its officials,
and the people have a voice.

07:21.440 --> 07:23.800
She can't rule over everyone yet.

07:31.160 --> 07:32.880
The 500 mu refers to fertile farmland.

07:32.960 --> 07:35.320
Beyond the hills, there's still plenty
of uncultivated wasteland,

07:35.920 --> 07:37.120
about another 500 mu.

07:37.720 --> 07:39.440
The harvests have been poor lately.

07:39.520 --> 07:40.960
Hutuo has kept raiding the border.

07:42.480 --> 07:44.360
Refugees are coming nonstop
from the north.

07:45.560 --> 07:47.000
Why not clear more land?

07:47.840 --> 07:49.520
The Han family
has built homes all over this area

07:49.600 --> 07:52.040
and raised vast estates,
taking on huge numbers of workers.

07:52.680 --> 07:54.480
The refugees all become
their bonded servants,

07:54.560 --> 07:56.160
working for free
and doing every kind of labor.

07:57.240 --> 07:58.920
They don't even have freedom.

07:59.000 --> 08:00.240
The wasteland they work so hard on.

08:00.920 --> 08:01.920
Who does it all end up to?

08:03.240 --> 08:05.480
The Han family
has controlled this area for years.

08:05.560 --> 08:08.280
They have vast fertile lands
and immense power.

08:09.120 --> 08:12.360
They have thousands of servants
and tens of thousands of dependents.

08:15.920 --> 08:17.600
Will the crops grown on this land…

08:20.040 --> 08:23.560
also become the Han family's wealth
to fund their private army?

08:24.160 --> 08:27.480
Exactly. He'll never give up
his hold on this place.

08:28.760 --> 08:32.919
He'll do everything he can
to drive you out for good.

08:34.159 --> 08:36.320
-What are you doing?
-Back up!

08:36.400 --> 08:37.679
-Get back!
-Back up!

08:38.280 --> 08:39.640
-Now we can't even use the well?
-What are you doing?

08:39.720 --> 08:41.880
-You're trying to kill us!
-Indeed.

08:41.960 --> 08:43.640
-Exactly!
-That's right!

08:43.720 --> 08:45.440
I said you can't use it, so you can't!

08:45.520 --> 08:46.440
Not even a drop!

08:46.520 --> 08:47.520
Smash them all!

08:47.600 --> 08:49.360
-Stop!
-Don't do this!

08:51.440 --> 08:52.480
What are you doing?

08:57.560 --> 08:58.720
Do you have a death wish?

08:59.480 --> 09:01.800
-Fang!
-Grandpa!

09:03.640 --> 09:05.000
No!

09:13.840 --> 09:15.160
I'll kill you!

09:22.440 --> 09:24.920
You've gone too far! Seize them!

09:25.000 --> 09:26.080
Nobody move!

09:32.360 --> 09:34.640
Your Ladyship, please save us!

09:34.720 --> 09:37.320
None of us can survive like this!

09:37.400 --> 09:41.120
Everyone, kneel! Beg Her Ladyship!

09:41.200 --> 09:44.000
Kneel! Beg Her Ladyship!

09:44.840 --> 09:47.200
Please save us!

09:49.080 --> 09:52.240
Please, Your Ladyship!

09:55.840 --> 10:02.320
Your Ladyship, please save us!

10:14.320 --> 10:15.160
Han Liao!

10:18.160 --> 10:19.720
I'll make you and your lackeys

10:20.320 --> 10:22.800
run away with your tails
between your legs!

10:22.880 --> 10:24.560
And leave this land forever!

10:28.040 --> 10:30.480
Did you all hear what she just said?

10:30.560 --> 10:32.440
Such bold words.

10:32.520 --> 10:34.560
I'm absolutely terrified.

10:34.640 --> 10:35.800
Barely made a Noble Lady,

10:35.880 --> 10:38.440
and already you think
you're above everyone.

10:38.520 --> 10:44.360
I'd love to see how Noble Lady Wu'an
plans to drive me out herself!

10:45.440 --> 10:46.520
No!

10:49.240 --> 10:50.440
Bullying the old and weak.

10:50.520 --> 10:52.200
How despicable!

10:53.440 --> 10:55.600
Fetch the physician.
Help the wounded get treatment.

10:56.680 --> 10:57.600
Yes.

10:59.720 --> 11:01.880
My Lord, didn't you say

11:01.960 --> 11:04.400
Lord Han had another beautiful estate
that he gave me as well?

11:04.480 --> 11:05.320
I'd like to see it.

11:05.920 --> 11:07.320
It's just ahead. Let's go.

11:16.640 --> 11:19.560
Keep watch. If anyone makes a move,

11:19.640 --> 11:20.960
tie up and send to the magistrate's.

11:30.640 --> 11:31.920
Keep a close eye on them!

11:32.560 --> 11:34.080
My Lord, should we…

11:34.760 --> 11:35.600
No rush.

11:36.200 --> 11:39.280
I control the only irrigation canal.

11:39.800 --> 11:42.000
What can she possibly do?

11:44.480 --> 11:47.640
Sooner or later,
she'll come crawling back to beg me.

11:52.360 --> 11:53.800
All along the way,

11:53.880 --> 11:56.720
flowers bloom in the east,
while grapevines fill the west.

11:57.240 --> 12:00.760
From the Lingbi stones in the garden
to the golden-red fish in the pond,

12:00.840 --> 12:02.360
and the colorful parrots on their perches,

12:02.880 --> 12:05.120
every treasure here cost a fortune.

12:06.000 --> 12:08.000
Opulent, yet tasteful.

12:08.080 --> 12:09.920
Extravagant, yet full of charm.

12:10.000 --> 12:12.200
No wonder Han Liao knows
how to please the Empress Dowager.

12:12.280 --> 12:14.200
He certainly knows
how to enjoy the finer things.

12:14.800 --> 12:16.880
But this estate is yours now.

12:17.400 --> 12:19.160
You rarely spent time
in the capital before.

12:19.240 --> 12:20.360
Most people don't know you.

12:20.880 --> 12:23.840
Use your title as Noble Lady Wu'an
to invite the noble families

12:23.920 --> 12:25.800
and build some useful connections.

12:27.360 --> 12:29.240
That huge Lingbi stone we just saw

12:29.760 --> 12:32.080
was hauled over a thousand li
from the south to the capital.

12:32.600 --> 12:35.040
Who knows how many died along the way?

12:36.280 --> 12:38.800
You said you'd drive Han Liao
out for good.

12:38.880 --> 12:40.480
That won't be easy.

12:41.000 --> 12:42.480
The refugees and thugs who follow him

12:42.560 --> 12:43.400
will keep coming.

12:44.000 --> 12:45.800
The moment swords
are drawn and blood is spilled,

12:45.880 --> 12:47.560
the Han family will have
countless charges ready against you.

12:48.240 --> 12:50.120
They've probably
already written the accusations.

12:50.880 --> 12:52.720
They're just waiting for you
to walk into their trap.

12:53.240 --> 12:57.880
CAISHU HALL

12:58.880 --> 13:00.080
I do need to host a gathering.

13:01.160 --> 13:02.000
Now you're talking.

13:02.600 --> 13:05.560
Have the Duchess of Ying host it
and invite the Eldest Princess.

13:06.440 --> 13:08.440
Let's see if the Han family
still dares to cause trouble.

13:08.520 --> 13:09.360
THE FRAGRANT ORCHID

13:09.440 --> 13:12.760
Once the Eldest Princess arrives,
the refugees will vanish.

13:12.840 --> 13:13.960
But once the royals leave,

13:14.040 --> 13:18.680
they'll show up like moles
all across the fields again.

13:20.800 --> 13:22.160
That's how ruthless Han Liao is.

13:23.120 --> 13:26.600
I won't invite the noble families.
Nor any imperial relatives.

13:29.760 --> 13:31.280
Then who will you invite?

13:31.360 --> 13:32.320
The people.

13:33.280 --> 13:34.120
No.

13:36.400 --> 13:37.920
I'll invite the voices no one can silence.

13:41.280 --> 13:43.160
My Lord, these past two days,

13:43.240 --> 13:44.600
quite a few scholars
have come to the estate.

13:44.680 --> 13:48.320
I cut off her canal
and ruined the livelihood of the fields.

13:49.080 --> 13:51.440
She should be taking those refugees
to petition His Majesty.

13:52.120 --> 13:53.920
Why is she hiding instead?

13:54.000 --> 13:56.080
My Lord, since the indentures
and deeds are destroyed,

13:56.160 --> 13:57.920
why don't we just seize the estate?

13:58.000 --> 14:00.720
Idiot. His Majesty gave his word.

14:00.800 --> 14:04.080
We can't act so openly
and give them grounds against us.

14:07.120 --> 14:07.960
Go on.

14:08.040 --> 14:12.440
Why has Noble Lady Wu'an gathered
all those penniless scholars?

14:12.520 --> 14:15.040
Everyone says Noble Lady Wu'an
is incredibly generous to guests.

14:15.120 --> 14:17.360
She holds feasts every day
for anyone who comes.

14:17.440 --> 14:19.560
Anyone can attend.
Her Ladyship charges nothing.

14:19.640 --> 14:21.000
She has only one condition.

14:21.080 --> 14:22.760
Before leaving, every guest
must leave behind a work of art.

14:22.840 --> 14:23.800
Poetry or paintings, either will do,

14:23.880 --> 14:25.800
but they must praise her beauty
and generosity

14:25.880 --> 14:27.520
and spread her fame throughout the realm.

14:27.600 --> 14:29.880
If the work is good,
she even pays them for it.

14:30.920 --> 14:33.400
I thought she'd risk everything
for those paupers.

14:34.000 --> 14:35.920
Turns out she's just chasing fame,

14:36.000 --> 14:38.480
feeding a bunch of freeloading parasites

14:39.080 --> 14:42.560
so they'll sing her praises.

14:44.560 --> 14:45.760
Vain and shortsighted.

14:46.360 --> 14:47.560
Can I go now?

14:47.640 --> 14:49.480
-If I'm late, I'll miss the feast.
-Get lost.

14:52.320 --> 14:53.840
I gave her far too much credit.

15:16.920 --> 15:18.200
Is everything ready?

15:18.280 --> 15:20.760
Everything is ready
as your Ladyship ordered.

15:24.200 --> 15:25.080
Your Ladyship.

15:28.680 --> 15:31.520
-Greetings, Your Ladyship.
-Greetings, Your Ladyship.

15:34.000 --> 15:34.840
Everyone.

15:44.080 --> 15:45.320
Liu Ziyang.

15:45.400 --> 15:48.000
You're usually arrogant
and think you're above everyone. Fine.

15:48.800 --> 15:50.320
But Noble Lady Wu'an
invited you to her feast.

15:50.400 --> 15:53.800
You stuffed yourself,
yet couldn't even thank your host?

15:53.880 --> 15:55.600
What kind of manners are those?

15:55.680 --> 15:57.120
-Exactly.
-That's right.

15:57.200 --> 15:59.800
-It's improper.
-That's hardly decent.

15:59.880 --> 16:02.400
Your Ladyship is certainly beautiful,

16:03.000 --> 16:04.400
but I see little talent or virtue.

16:04.920 --> 16:06.640
You earned a title
without a single achievement

16:07.240 --> 16:08.680
and then bought yourself
a good name with petty favors.

16:09.560 --> 16:12.600
Yet you fail to understand
that the finest swords come from Wuyue…

16:12.680 --> 16:13.560
Liu Ziyang!

16:13.640 --> 16:15.640
And the finest jade comes from Mount Jing.

16:15.720 --> 16:17.360
A phoenix only chooses
a worthy place to land.

16:18.160 --> 16:20.800
The wise have always followed
those worthy of serving.

16:21.760 --> 16:24.240
Your Ladyship buys loyalty
with fine wine and meat.

16:25.280 --> 16:27.640
All you attract are useless freeloaders.

16:27.720 --> 16:28.760
-You…
-You!

16:28.840 --> 16:30.480
-And those silly verses they wrote?
-What does he say?

16:30.560 --> 16:32.480
-How arrogant.
-My advice to Your Ladyship

16:32.560 --> 16:34.000
is not to spread them around.

16:34.600 --> 16:36.600
You'll only make yourself a laughingstock.

16:36.680 --> 16:39.240
Liu Ziyang,
who are you calling freeloaders?

16:39.320 --> 16:40.800
She invited you here out of kindness.

16:40.880 --> 16:42.360
How dare you be so rude?

16:42.440 --> 16:43.720
Ungrateful and shameless!

16:43.800 --> 16:45.120
You're a disgrace to all scholars!

16:45.840 --> 16:46.720
-Exactly!
-That's right!

16:46.800 --> 16:48.600
-Shameless!
-Absolutely shameless!

16:48.680 --> 16:50.480
-Stop.
-Ashamed to be with him.

16:53.000 --> 16:54.040
What?

16:55.800 --> 16:56.840
Is Your Ladyship going to kill me?

17:05.720 --> 17:07.160
I made it clear from the start.

17:07.680 --> 17:10.720
Every scholar who attends my feast
receives a parting gift.

17:11.640 --> 17:12.920
Please accept it, sir.

17:22.599 --> 17:24.040
How ugly.

17:25.560 --> 17:28.160
-How can he say that?
-That's simply outrageous.

17:28.240 --> 17:29.800
-Good! nicely done!
-Serves him right!

17:30.400 --> 17:32.960
Everyone here
came to speak up for the people.

17:33.560 --> 17:35.400
We have no use for someone
who judges by looks

17:35.480 --> 17:37.040
and is as arrogant as he is ignorant!

17:37.640 --> 17:38.920
-Throw him out.
-Yes.

17:47.040 --> 17:48.440
-Your Ladyship!
-Your Ladyship!

17:48.520 --> 17:54.600
-Your Ladyship!
-Please give us justice! Your Ladyship!

17:54.680 --> 17:55.560
CAISHU HALL

17:55.640 --> 17:58.800
-Please give us justice, Your Ladyship!
-Please give us justice!

17:58.880 --> 18:02.840
Your Ladyship, please give us justice!

18:04.560 --> 18:05.840
Please give us justice!

18:05.920 --> 18:07.520
Please don't kneel.
If you've been wronged,

18:07.600 --> 18:08.560
just tell me what happened.

18:08.640 --> 18:10.760
The Han family cut off our only canal.

18:10.840 --> 18:14.640
Our crops are about to die!

18:15.320 --> 18:18.440
They seized our fields
and took over the wells.

18:18.520 --> 18:22.960
More than half our livestock
have died of thirst…

18:23.040 --> 18:24.840
Look at these wounds.

18:24.920 --> 18:27.320
The Han family's men did this to us.

18:27.400 --> 18:29.120
Please, have mercy.

18:29.200 --> 18:31.240
Please save us!

18:31.320 --> 18:35.840
Please save us, Your Ladyship!

18:35.920 --> 18:40.840
-Please give us justice, Your Ladyship!
-What can we do?

18:42.760 --> 18:43.640
Your Ladyship.

18:44.440 --> 18:46.880
We're just poor scholars
from humble families.

18:47.640 --> 18:49.240
We can barely feed and clothe ourselves.

18:49.920 --> 18:53.040
What power could we possibly have
to save all these people?

18:57.800 --> 19:03.080
You are all learned men,
the future pillars of this nation.

19:03.720 --> 19:05.560
Your day to soar will surely come.

19:05.640 --> 19:07.640
You won't be down on your luck forever.

19:08.280 --> 19:09.760
I'd like to do what little I can

19:10.280 --> 19:12.480
and provide simple meals
and lodging each day.

19:12.560 --> 19:15.480
You're all welcome to stay
and focus on your studies.

19:17.440 --> 19:23.840
But the grain and vegetables here
are all grown by the local people.

19:24.440 --> 19:29.480
If they're driven to ruin,
this estate won't survive either.

19:34.080 --> 19:37.200
So please put your talents to use
and speak from the heart.

19:37.920 --> 19:40.560
Write poems about the people's suffering.

19:42.280 --> 19:44.240
CAISHU HALL

19:56.400 --> 19:57.480
How could I, Liu Ziyang,

19:57.560 --> 20:01.840
miss a righteous cause like
fighting evil and helping the people?

20:02.520 --> 20:03.800
We don't need you.

20:14.680 --> 20:17.280
I was blind and foolish.

20:17.360 --> 20:19.760
You care for the people's
suffering and hardships.

20:19.840 --> 20:20.960
You truly have a heart of gold.

20:21.560 --> 20:23.360
I sincerely beg your forgiveness.

20:24.000 --> 20:26.720
It's never too late to admit mistakes.

20:26.800 --> 20:27.960
You're defending him?

20:36.440 --> 20:39.040
Your Ladyship's noble heart
has won my deepest respect.

20:40.120 --> 20:41.320
But while we're here,

20:41.840 --> 20:45.320
eating the grain these people grow
and drinking the wine they brew,

20:46.040 --> 20:47.840
how can we stay silent
just because we fear the powerful?

20:49.480 --> 20:51.960
-If you won't, I will!
-Are you writing or not?

20:55.400 --> 20:56.280
You've misunderstood.

20:56.880 --> 20:58.960
I'm not asking you
to risk petitioning the court,

20:59.040 --> 21:00.760
or offend the powerful.

21:00.840 --> 21:03.360
Just write a few simple rhymes
or folk verses.

21:04.000 --> 21:09.000
Ideally, a catchy tune that even
the unlettered can sing along to.

21:09.080 --> 21:10.280
Catchy tunes?

21:10.360 --> 21:11.360
So that's what she meant.

21:11.440 --> 21:12.440
That's easy to write.

21:13.120 --> 21:14.480
That's all?

21:16.880 --> 21:20.120
Her Ladyship asked you to write,
so get to it.

21:20.200 --> 21:22.240
Do it well, and Her Ladyship
will reward you handsomely.

21:25.480 --> 21:26.400
Come on, let's go.

21:26.480 --> 21:28.080
-Let's get ink and brushes.
-I'll write.

21:34.080 --> 21:35.360
Everyone, please get up!

21:35.960 --> 21:41.880
-Thank you, Your Ladyship!
-Thank you, Your Ladyship!

21:47.840 --> 21:48.680
THE FRAGRANT ORCHID

21:48.760 --> 21:50.160
You've written this one?

21:50.240 --> 21:51.840
-Nice one.
-Well written.

21:51.920 --> 21:54.000
-How charming.
-Take a look at mine.

21:54.080 --> 21:56.000
-You know where to spread these?
-Yes, I do.

21:56.080 --> 21:57.240
That's real talent.

21:57.320 --> 21:59.080
-Leave it to me.
-What are you doing?

21:59.680 --> 22:01.480
-Nice.
-Let's read yours.

22:01.560 --> 22:02.600
My Lord.

22:03.920 --> 22:05.600
There are places you can't get into.

22:05.680 --> 22:06.840
I'll have to arrange those myself.

22:07.360 --> 22:08.280
Leave everything to Jiede.

22:09.240 --> 22:10.160
Yes.

22:10.880 --> 22:12.600
Rao is entertaining guests inside, right?
I'll go take a look.

22:12.680 --> 22:13.760
My Lord.

22:15.400 --> 22:16.240
What is it?

22:17.200 --> 22:19.080
Your Ladyship invited scholars
from everywhere.

22:20.000 --> 22:20.960
Why can't I go?

22:21.760 --> 22:23.040
Her Ladyship said

22:23.120 --> 22:26.320
the Han family resents
her most for taking this land.

22:26.400 --> 22:28.000
It had nothing to do with the Lu family.

22:28.080 --> 22:29.520
As long as you stay out of it,

22:29.600 --> 22:32.480
this remains a private feud
between her and the Han family.

22:32.560 --> 22:34.720
If you keep getting involved
with the estate,

22:34.800 --> 22:37.000
the feud between the Lu and Han families
will only deepen.

22:37.080 --> 22:39.680
Besides,
the hall is full of scholars today.

22:39.760 --> 22:40.920
If you go inside,

22:41.000 --> 22:45.120
people may accuse the Lu family
of recruiting followers

22:45.200 --> 22:47.200
-for its own gain.
-It doesn't sound like a ballad at all.

22:52.000 --> 22:54.240
Good one here. This one too.

22:54.920 --> 22:56.200
Mine will be remembered for the ages!

22:58.240 --> 22:59.760
She doesn't mind troubling Qi Zhongkai

23:00.440 --> 23:03.520
or dragging outsiders into this,
but she's afraid of troubling me.

23:05.400 --> 23:07.080
How thoughtful of her.

23:07.160 --> 23:08.360
What a considerate wife.

23:10.480 --> 23:11.320
Your Ladyship.

23:11.920 --> 23:12.920
-Hurry!
-Let her see it.

23:13.000 --> 23:13.960
Yes, yes!

23:14.520 --> 23:15.640
-Your Ladyship.
-Your Ladyship.

23:15.720 --> 23:17.560
-Please read this one.
-Mine too.

23:17.640 --> 23:18.640
THE FRAGRANT ORCHID

23:18.720 --> 23:19.800
Show it to Her Ladyship.

23:20.920 --> 23:21.840
MARQUIS OF XITING'S RESIDENCE

23:21.920 --> 23:24.560
Look at the rat. It still has skin

23:24.640 --> 23:27.080
Yet a man has no shame

23:27.680 --> 23:33.040
If a man has no shame,
why does he still live?

23:33.120 --> 23:36.280
Look at the rat. It still has teeth.

23:36.360 --> 23:40.320
-Yet a man knows no bounds.
-What nonsense are you spouting? Go!

23:40.400 --> 23:42.120
-Come hit me!
-Stop talking nonsense!

23:42.200 --> 23:43.520
-Hit me!
-Come on, hit me!

23:43.600 --> 23:44.440
-My Lord.
-Run!

23:44.520 --> 23:45.400
I'll bring them back at once.

23:46.720 --> 23:48.440
The palace summons must be urgent.

23:48.520 --> 23:50.560
We can't delay.
We'll go to the palace first.

23:51.160 --> 23:52.000
Yes.

23:53.640 --> 23:55.160
That corrupt official
treats lives like nothing!

23:55.240 --> 23:56.200
A butcher!

23:56.840 --> 23:59.880
These rich and powerful men
all treat human lives as worthless.

23:59.960 --> 24:01.000
Corrupt official!

24:04.760 --> 24:06.560
"Last year I passed Mount Yaowang,

24:07.200 --> 24:08.960
and heard the people's cries of injustice.

24:09.600 --> 24:11.480
Now the canal is cut, and many lie dead.

24:12.080 --> 24:14.160
The grain is stained
with the people's blood."

24:17.840 --> 24:21.040
"The Han kitchens overflow with meat,
their stables with fat horses.

24:21.760 --> 24:25.040
Yet the people starve,
and bodies litter the fields!"

24:27.080 --> 24:28.480
The whole city is talking.

24:29.120 --> 24:31.880
They say your Han family
seized the people's land,

24:31.960 --> 24:34.080
lives in excess
while bleeding the realm and its people,

24:34.160 --> 24:35.120
and deceives the throne!

24:36.560 --> 24:38.400
So answer me, Han Liao!

24:39.240 --> 24:42.840
How much can one man possibly eat?

24:42.920 --> 24:44.320
How many beds can one man sleep in?

24:44.400 --> 24:47.080
How did your greed become so boundless?

24:47.160 --> 24:50.040
I deserve death!
These are malicious false accusations!

24:50.640 --> 24:51.640
False accusations?

24:51.720 --> 24:53.280
Ten essays condemning corrupt officials,

24:53.960 --> 24:56.680
30 folk songs and 18 long poems!

24:57.280 --> 24:59.640
How vile must you be

25:00.240 --> 25:03.800
for the people
to want to flay you and devour your flesh,

25:04.400 --> 25:07.680
and for all those scholars
to condemn you as a corrupt villain?

25:07.760 --> 25:10.600
Han Liao,
the people say you deserve death!

25:13.920 --> 25:16.000
To appease people's anger
and quell public outrage,

25:16.520 --> 25:18.440
even if every charge were false,

25:19.040 --> 25:21.840
you'd still deserve death
by a thousand cuts!

25:23.240 --> 25:25.440
I deserve death! I am guilty!

25:26.040 --> 25:27.040
Your Majesty.

25:27.120 --> 25:31.920
I'll have the canal reopened at once
and compensate the injured people.

25:32.520 --> 25:35.920
I'll personally apologize
to Noble Lady Wu'an.

25:38.520 --> 25:39.360
Your Majesty.

25:41.080 --> 25:43.840
Lord Han offered his land
to escape punishment,

25:43.920 --> 25:46.880
then cut off the canal
and ruined the people's livelihood.

25:48.160 --> 25:49.520
He is a criminal
who deceived Your Majesty.

25:50.120 --> 25:51.240
Lord Lu!

25:52.000 --> 25:54.040
The tenant farmers
rejected their new master.

25:54.120 --> 25:55.440
They caused the trouble themselves.

25:57.600 --> 26:01.640
As for cutting off the canal,
I knew nothing about it.

26:01.720 --> 26:04.920
Powerful clans have long seized land
and forced commoners into servitude.

26:05.000 --> 26:06.160
It's a grave threat to the realm.

26:06.800 --> 26:09.440
It must be punished harshly
as a warning to others.

26:10.560 --> 26:12.600
Your Majesty, at Bailu Plain,

26:12.680 --> 26:14.200
the Empress Dowager's tomb
is under construction.

26:15.160 --> 26:19.480
Why not move the entire Han clan
to the counties around the tomb?

26:20.240 --> 26:22.680
That would also stop a few refugees
from causing trouble.

26:23.600 --> 26:24.560
Your Majesty!

26:24.640 --> 26:26.720
The Han clan would gladly
give our lives for the realm.

26:27.320 --> 26:29.280
How could we leave Your Majesty's grace?

26:29.360 --> 26:32.200
Building the tomb
is a matter of state. Unless…

26:33.320 --> 26:36.320
Lord Han
refuses to serve the Empress Dowager!

26:36.400 --> 26:37.280
Lu Zhuo, you…

26:37.880 --> 26:40.320
Enough. That's settled.

26:41.680 --> 26:44.240
The Han family has enraged the people.

26:44.320 --> 26:46.360
I have no choice but to punish you.

26:47.040 --> 26:48.760
Go outside and take 50 strokes.

26:49.680 --> 26:50.720
And one more thing.

26:50.800 --> 26:53.360
Noble Lady Wu'an
spared you from hard labor,

26:53.440 --> 26:54.600
yet you repaid her kindness with betrayal.

26:54.680 --> 26:58.040
So I sentence you
to serve Wu'an as a servant for one month

26:58.800 --> 27:00.200
to make amends.

27:03.080 --> 27:04.080
I…

27:09.160 --> 27:10.000
I accept Your Majesty's decree.

27:36.080 --> 27:39.280
You spread rumors
to destroy everything I've built.

27:39.880 --> 27:43.040
Then you schemed
to have my clan exiled to Bailu Plain.

27:43.720 --> 27:45.840
How vile and ruthless.

27:46.920 --> 27:51.000
But who would ever know
that the honorable Lord Lu

27:51.080 --> 27:55.640
is actually cold-blooded and vicious?

27:56.280 --> 27:57.440
Han Liao.

28:00.080 --> 28:01.880
The night our army raided the Hutuo camp,

28:03.360 --> 28:05.600
who betrayed his own men for selfish gain

28:06.400 --> 28:09.960
and left them to die far from home,
their souls unable to rest?

28:11.120 --> 28:14.560
That blood debt has never left my mind.

28:15.440 --> 28:17.360
Sooner or later, we'll settle it.

28:18.040 --> 28:20.560
You have no proof. It's pure slander!

28:24.640 --> 28:26.720
Don't celebrate too soon.

28:28.400 --> 28:29.360
The woman you married

28:30.360 --> 28:32.280
is clearly a venomous snake.

28:35.000 --> 28:37.240
Sooner or later, you'll die by her hands.

28:45.600 --> 28:46.640
No need to be jealous.

28:53.160 --> 28:55.120
You'll never have that luck to end.

29:14.000 --> 29:16.120
MARQUIS OF XITING'S RESIDENCE

29:25.120 --> 29:26.080
Get out!

29:37.040 --> 29:40.200
My Lord. Let me clean you up.

29:58.760 --> 30:01.040
You're the daughter
of the Marquis of Andu,

30:01.120 --> 30:04.720
yet you spend every day cowering
like you're ashamed to be seen.

30:06.680 --> 30:08.880
I wasted 50,000 gold coins buying you.

30:09.560 --> 30:11.920
You walk around looking miserable all day.

30:13.200 --> 30:16.120
Your whole family is useless,
with nothing but empty titles!

30:17.840 --> 30:19.440
What good are you to me?

30:50.560 --> 30:51.760
My wife went to admire
the moon in the garden

30:52.840 --> 30:54.400
and tragically drowned in the lake.

30:55.760 --> 30:57.680
Send word to the Empress Dowager.

30:59.280 --> 31:01.480
Tell her the Han family
must hold a funeral,

31:02.200 --> 31:04.120
so our clan cannot leave
the capital for now.

31:07.280 --> 31:09.720
As for relocating the clan
and my month of servitude,

31:11.520 --> 31:14.920
ask the Empress Dowager
to appeal to His Majesty for us.

31:17.600 --> 31:20.080
We'll need a little more time.

31:28.960 --> 31:31.120
After all, the dead come first.

31:34.840 --> 31:37.760
I'm sure Noble Lady Wu'an…

31:40.760 --> 31:42.640
will understand.

31:44.800 --> 31:46.160
-It looks really good.
-Really?

31:47.680 --> 31:49.000
-Have some water first.
-Three!

31:52.840 --> 31:53.880
Four!

31:54.560 --> 31:56.520
His Lordship sent me here
as a martial arts instructor,

31:56.600 --> 31:58.040
but General Qi took all the work.

31:58.640 --> 32:00.560
-He even said…
-Keep your stance steady!

32:00.640 --> 32:01.640
What did he say?

32:01.720 --> 32:03.560
He said this is Noble Lady Wu'an's estate.

32:03.640 --> 32:05.000
-Everyone must obey Her Ladyship.
-Five!

32:05.080 --> 32:06.640
Her Ladyship asked him
to find an instructor,

32:06.720 --> 32:07.960
so Your Lordship needn't trouble yourself.

32:08.040 --> 32:09.160
What kind of nonsense?

32:09.240 --> 32:11.360
Her Ladyship is also Lord Lu's wife.
She's our lady too.

32:11.440 --> 32:12.560
If your orders…

32:12.640 --> 32:13.840
-Stop.
-don't work here…

32:14.360 --> 32:15.720
-Six!
-He's the one overstepping,

32:15.800 --> 32:16.640
like he's the master here.

32:17.400 --> 32:20.400
Those blind fools probably think
he's Her Ladyship's husband!

32:21.400 --> 32:22.600
Hold it!

32:27.160 --> 32:28.640
-Up!
-My Lord.

32:31.560 --> 32:32.920
You idiot! Can't you take a hint?

32:33.000 --> 32:33.840
Just running your mouth.

32:33.920 --> 32:35.400
And you made it worse by tattling.

32:36.000 --> 32:37.600
-You've really messed things up.
-Keep going!

32:37.680 --> 32:39.280
I was only worried about His Lordship.

32:39.360 --> 32:40.560
-Eight!
-Losing men is one thing.

32:40.640 --> 32:41.880
-Losing his wife is worse.
-Enough!

32:42.600 --> 32:44.920
You haven't trained long enough!
Your basics are weak!

32:45.000 --> 32:45.960
My Lord!

32:46.040 --> 32:47.640
I teach moves meant
for killing on the battlefield.

32:47.720 --> 32:49.760
Attack. Don't defend!

32:50.360 --> 32:51.200
Keep your back straight!

32:52.040 --> 32:53.080
Nine!

32:55.560 --> 32:57.160
You have no idea.

32:57.240 --> 32:59.880
When the Han family's lands
and servants were divided up,

32:59.960 --> 33:01.760
everyone in the capital
had something to say.

33:02.440 --> 33:04.880
Some said the Han family
were relatives of the Empress Dowager,

33:04.960 --> 33:07.280
and Han Liao was one of her favorites.

33:07.360 --> 33:09.720
They said anyone who took their land

33:09.800 --> 33:12.480
would be asking for trouble.

33:13.000 --> 33:15.440
Now His Majesty had Han Liao flogged.

33:15.520 --> 33:17.640
If the Han family
hadn't just suffered a death

33:17.720 --> 33:19.120
and the Empress Dowager hadn't intervened,

33:19.800 --> 33:22.160
the whole clan would've been
sent away to build the tomb.

33:22.760 --> 33:26.280
Now the talk in the capital
has completely changed.

33:26.360 --> 33:31.000
Everyone says our Noble Lady
is blessed beyond measure.

33:31.520 --> 33:35.480
They all change sides
the second the wind shifts.

33:36.880 --> 33:40.880
I hear your new estate
has the charm of the countryside,

33:40.960 --> 33:42.000
like some heavenly retreat.

33:42.080 --> 33:46.800
All my friends keep asking me
when you'll finally host us there

33:46.880 --> 33:49.800
and open the estate
so everyone can come enjoy it.

33:49.880 --> 33:51.480
Yesterday, second cousin even said

33:51.560 --> 33:54.480
he wants to invite some noble friends

33:54.560 --> 33:56.480
and hunt a few wild animals.

33:56.560 --> 34:00.160
They say braised muntjac gives you
strength to cross three mountains.

34:00.920 --> 34:02.960
Let's go to the estate
for barbecue and wine.

34:03.920 --> 34:07.160
Rao, we'll just borrow your estate.

34:07.240 --> 34:10.040
We'll bring everything we need ourselves.
How about it?

34:11.440 --> 34:12.400
No, no.

34:13.280 --> 34:15.760
These youngsters only care about fun,

34:15.840 --> 34:17.679
not knowing there's more
between noble families.

34:18.320 --> 34:20.600
Friends, foes, allies, spies…

34:20.679 --> 34:21.880
Everyone has an agenda.

34:21.960 --> 34:23.440
They're waiting to see our responses.

34:23.520 --> 34:26.840
So, we might as well
openly invite them all

34:26.920 --> 34:29.320
and let them
see everything for themselves.

34:29.400 --> 34:30.920
That makes sense.

34:33.239 --> 34:37.159
We're family,
so we shouldn't draw lines between us.

34:37.760 --> 34:40.040
But this estate is different.

34:40.120 --> 34:43.080
Wei Rao earned it herself.

34:43.159 --> 34:44.800
That's not right, Sister.

34:45.400 --> 34:47.520
Han Liao framed the Lu family.

34:47.600 --> 34:51.120
This estate and its lands
were compensation from the Han family.

34:51.800 --> 34:54.679
When Han Liao used his power
to cause trouble at the ancestral temple,

34:55.280 --> 34:57.080
I didn't see you risk your life
to stop him.

34:57.160 --> 35:00.960
At Xuanshi Palace,
under pressure from the Imperial Family,

35:01.040 --> 35:03.200
I didn't see you challenge
the Empress Dowager and Prince Rong.

35:03.960 --> 35:06.440
When the Hans cut off the water
and hurt the farmers,

35:06.520 --> 35:08.560
I didn't see you step up and help either.

35:09.240 --> 35:11.240
Now that everything's peaceful,

35:11.320 --> 35:15.280
you either want to hunt or throw a feast.

35:15.920 --> 35:16.840
How can you even ask?

35:16.920 --> 35:18.320
What do you mean by that?

35:19.000 --> 35:21.680
Ask Noble Lady Wu'an yourself. This land…

35:22.200 --> 35:24.040
Was it really so easy to claim?

35:24.120 --> 35:26.680
The Duke's Residence
backed her all the way.

35:27.360 --> 35:29.480
When the Hans caused trouble
at the ancestral temple,

35:29.560 --> 35:31.640
which of our brothers
didn't step in to help?

35:31.720 --> 35:33.280
-Go on, tell me. Go on!
-Enough.

35:33.360 --> 35:34.720
Enough.

35:35.240 --> 35:36.920
We only meant well.

35:37.800 --> 35:39.680
The Han family is cunning and vicious.

35:40.280 --> 35:42.440
They're experts at dirty tricks.

35:42.520 --> 35:44.360
If we invite the noble families here,

35:44.440 --> 35:46.640
we'll make it clear
this is Lu family property.

35:47.160 --> 35:49.800
That'll stop anyone else from coveting it.

35:49.880 --> 35:53.600
Privately, it'll still be your estate,
Your Ladyship.

35:53.680 --> 35:56.960
We already said we'd only borrow it.
Just borrowing it.

35:57.040 --> 35:58.240
Just borrow it.

35:58.320 --> 35:59.920
-Even so…
-Mother, please decide.

36:04.360 --> 36:07.720
Rao, this is your decision to make.

36:07.800 --> 36:10.920
Can you handle it all on your own?

36:26.520 --> 36:28.600
Thank you, Aunts, for looking out for me.

36:28.680 --> 36:31.680
But right now,
the estate is still under renovation.

36:31.760 --> 36:33.400
It's not ready for guests yet.

36:33.480 --> 36:36.600
Everyone knows the Han family built

36:36.680 --> 36:38.920
a lavish estate
filled with grand pavilions.

36:39.680 --> 36:42.040
This estate even rivals
an imperial retreat.

36:42.640 --> 36:46.400
Rao, are you just reluctant to share it
and making excuses?

36:46.480 --> 36:48.160
You child…

36:48.240 --> 36:49.640
Bitao.

36:51.360 --> 36:52.440
Old Madam, please take a look.

36:54.440 --> 36:56.960
The Hutuo have raided
the border repeatedly in recent years.

36:57.040 --> 36:58.320
War has ravaged the north.

36:58.400 --> 37:00.120
The people are suffering and displaced.

37:00.200 --> 37:01.520
When winter comes,

37:01.600 --> 37:03.560
even more refugees will head south.

37:03.640 --> 37:06.200
So I plan to build,
in front of the residences,

37:06.280 --> 37:08.600
threshing yards, silkworm rooms,
and workshops,

37:08.680 --> 37:09.520
along with livestock pens.

37:10.120 --> 37:13.080
We'll stockpile plenty of winter supplies
so we can shelter more refugees.

37:14.040 --> 37:15.560
The estate sits at the foot
of Mount Yaowang.

37:16.160 --> 37:18.920
This hillside
must be cleared before winter

37:19.000 --> 37:20.720
and planted with
cold-and drought-resistant fruit trees.

37:21.400 --> 37:23.360
The soil in this valley is poor,

37:23.440 --> 37:24.880
but there's plenty of sunlight.

37:24.960 --> 37:26.920
Next year, after improving the soil,

37:27.000 --> 37:28.640
we can grow medicinal herbs and flowers.

37:30.760 --> 37:31.680
As for these homes,

37:31.760 --> 37:34.280
I'll rent them cheaply
to poor scholars and commoners.

37:34.360 --> 37:36.440
Those who can't afford rent
can work it off.

37:37.080 --> 37:38.320
But if we do that,

37:38.400 --> 37:40.600
the estate won't be fit for
entertaining noble families.

37:40.680 --> 37:42.560
If you want to be charitable,

37:42.640 --> 37:44.600
just give out more money and grain.

37:44.680 --> 37:48.160
But giving such a fine estate
to those common people

37:48.840 --> 37:50.360
would be such a waste.

37:50.440 --> 37:51.680
You're the wife of a noble heir,

37:52.360 --> 37:54.680
yet all you talk about are fields, farms,
sheep pens, and pigsties.

37:54.760 --> 37:56.120
People will laugh at you.

37:56.200 --> 37:57.040
You're far too calculating.

37:57.120 --> 37:59.360
Changning, watch your tongue.

37:59.960 --> 38:02.240
Anyone can indulge in romance,
beauty, and luxury.

38:03.080 --> 38:06.800
But how many people today
would sacrifice themselves for others?

38:07.520 --> 38:09.720
I think this land… I…

38:12.080 --> 38:15.120
Rao, with everything planned this way,

38:15.200 --> 38:17.600
next year the livestock will thrive,

38:17.680 --> 38:18.960
and the orchards will bear abundant fruit.

38:19.040 --> 38:22.160
Trees, thorns, mulberry, and hemp
will turn this place into a market.

38:23.320 --> 38:24.680
This estate and its lands

38:24.760 --> 38:28.200
were nothing but a playground
for the Han family's pleasure.

38:28.280 --> 38:30.280
But in your hands,

38:30.360 --> 38:33.120
they can finally serve a real purpose.

38:36.440 --> 38:37.640
Good child.

38:38.160 --> 38:40.640
You have vision and generosity.

38:40.720 --> 38:44.880
Such selflessness is truly rare.
Remarkable.

38:44.960 --> 38:46.600
Yes. Remarkable!

38:47.760 --> 38:49.680
The Han family used the funeral
to delay their relocation.

38:50.480 --> 38:53.040
I'm afraid they'll go back on their word
and come back for trouble.

38:54.480 --> 38:57.160
So I turned this area
into a training ground

38:57.240 --> 39:00.400
and picked some strong young locals
to train so they can defend themselves.

39:01.000 --> 39:02.320
But I know nothing
about military strategy.

39:02.400 --> 39:04.040
I don't know where to set up defenses

39:04.120 --> 39:05.840
to protect the water source
and the estate.

39:07.080 --> 39:08.360
That's easy.

39:20.240 --> 39:22.600
Who knew a life of luxury
and careful upbringing

39:22.680 --> 39:24.400
could raise someone never work
and can't tell wheat from rice.

39:24.480 --> 39:25.440
Aim high, do nothing,

39:25.520 --> 39:27.240
and know nothing of the people's pain.

39:27.320 --> 39:29.240
Every great general's glory
is built on countless bones.

39:29.320 --> 39:31.720
Our family's honors are built on
countless soldiers' blood.

39:32.360 --> 39:33.760
They were all sons of poor farmers.

39:34.440 --> 39:36.120
You call them filthy commoners.

39:36.920 --> 39:38.120
Then what does that make you?

39:38.920 --> 39:39.840
Hiding behind our family's privilege,

39:40.440 --> 39:41.360
you're useless, yet you think
you're better than everyone else!

39:42.840 --> 39:45.520
Mother, he's gone too far!

39:45.600 --> 39:48.280
Our brothers only wanted to go hunting
and asked me to speak for them.

39:49.040 --> 39:51.440
It's hardly a terrible crime.

39:51.520 --> 39:52.960
There's no need to go this far.

39:53.040 --> 39:54.720
Changning only asked
because she meant well.

39:54.800 --> 39:55.840
She didn't mean well.

39:56.760 --> 39:58.200
She's selfish and greedy.

39:58.800 --> 40:00.440
Aunts, when you married
into the Lu family,

40:01.440 --> 40:02.960
when did we ever covet
your private property?

40:03.920 --> 40:05.000
Lu Changning.

40:05.080 --> 40:07.160
Those men call themselves real men,

40:07.880 --> 40:08.880
yet they sent you to ask?

40:09.520 --> 40:11.280
-Tell them to speak to me!
-Look, over here.

40:11.360 --> 40:12.880
My army could use a few more soldiers.

40:12.960 --> 40:15.680
I'll find them some real work
and give them a proper workout.

40:15.760 --> 40:17.640
Throwing your weight
around at home as the heir?

40:17.720 --> 40:19.240
Zhuo is right.

40:19.320 --> 40:20.400
That's exactly how it is.

40:20.480 --> 40:21.760
-But yell at his sister like that?
-Exactly.

40:21.840 --> 40:24.560
Enough! Are you all finished?

40:25.120 --> 40:27.200
-He…
-Zhuo, come here.

40:30.320 --> 40:33.680
Rao wants to train people
and set up defenses.

40:33.760 --> 40:35.200
Isn't that your specialty?

40:35.880 --> 40:37.520
You're an undefeated general.

40:37.600 --> 40:40.320
Surely you can help your wife.

40:41.640 --> 40:43.560
Grandmother, you don't know her.

40:43.640 --> 40:45.720
She handles everything herself
and hates troubling me.

40:46.400 --> 40:48.040
She has to actually let me help first.

40:48.640 --> 40:50.800
I've lived a long life,

40:50.880 --> 40:55.120
and I've never heard of a landowner
giving his own homes to tenant farmers.

40:55.720 --> 40:59.000
Rao's estate is truly unlike any other.

40:59.840 --> 41:00.720
Come.

41:00.800 --> 41:02.080
You two are husband and wife.

41:02.160 --> 41:05.880
You must stand together
and work toward the same goal.

41:05.960 --> 41:07.360
I want to see it with my own eyes

41:07.440 --> 41:11.760
as you two build this one-of-a-kind estate
from the ground up.

41:18.640 --> 41:19.880
Careful. Don't drop it.

41:27.960 --> 41:30.120
Your Ladyship, we're almost done packing.

41:30.640 --> 41:32.480
-Load these onto the carriage first.
-Yes.

41:33.120 --> 41:34.320
Take everything out.

41:34.400 --> 41:35.480
Yes.

41:41.080 --> 41:41.920
Rao, what's all this?

41:42.600 --> 41:43.920
Traveling between here
and the estate every day

41:44.000 --> 41:44.840
isn't convenient.

41:45.480 --> 41:46.680
I've already spoken to Grandmother.

41:47.360 --> 41:48.680
I'll stay at the estate for a while.

41:49.360 --> 41:50.400
You're moving out?

41:51.720 --> 41:52.840
And you didn't even tell me?

41:53.440 --> 41:55.120
I meant to discuss it with you,

41:55.200 --> 41:56.640
but you went to the palace
early this morning.

41:57.520 --> 41:59.000
So I had to inform Grandmother first.

41:59.880 --> 42:02.880
I'll make sure they're careful
with everything and don't damage anything.

42:03.560 --> 42:04.440
I'll explain everything when I get back.

42:25.560 --> 42:26.680
My Lord.

42:28.240 --> 42:29.560
Ever since we left Xianzhuang,

42:30.520 --> 42:33.680
you've addressed me as "My Lord"
and kept me at a distance.

42:34.920 --> 42:36.280
Did you think I wouldn't notice?

42:37.520 --> 42:39.120
You already know the truth.

42:39.640 --> 42:41.400
-I was never…
-You are.

42:50.680 --> 42:53.720
Unless Noble Lady Wu'an thinks
you no longer need me as your husband,

42:54.240 --> 42:55.560
or need my protection,

42:56.280 --> 42:57.720
you're free to cast aside
your title of my wife

42:57.800 --> 42:58.680
as if it meant nothing to you.

42:59.920 --> 43:03.680
Open that door and walk away
without any concern.

43:06.760 --> 43:08.880
-I…
-Wei Rao.

43:09.920 --> 43:12.280
I never know
when you're playing hard to get

43:12.360 --> 43:13.880
or when you're actually being sincere.

43:13.960 --> 43:16.720
You're unpredictable,
and you read people too well.

43:18.000 --> 43:20.200
You like seeing me jealous over you

43:21.440 --> 43:22.880
because it helps keep you safe.

43:24.160 --> 43:25.440
You're overthinking it, My Lord.

43:27.160 --> 43:28.280
I wouldn't dare.

43:28.360 --> 43:30.240
Don't try to fool me.

43:30.840 --> 43:32.720
I saw through your games long ago.

43:35.000 --> 43:36.400
Please forgive me, My Lord.

43:38.920 --> 43:40.840
I've struggled all my life to survive.

43:41.760 --> 43:42.760
I've only

43:44.280 --> 43:45.720
wanted to stay alive.

43:59.480 --> 44:02.520
One who commands soldiers
is called a general.

44:03.360 --> 44:05.640
One who commands generals
is called a commander.

44:06.240 --> 44:07.280
A game of chess is like a battlefield.

44:07.880 --> 44:10.560
The commander
is what decides victory from afar.

44:13.000 --> 44:14.240
You should know that.

44:15.240 --> 44:17.000
At a critical moment like this,

44:18.320 --> 44:19.480
who…

44:21.720 --> 44:23.440
is truly useful to you?

44:38.200 --> 44:40.320
The heir to the Duke of Ying, of course.

44:42.440 --> 44:44.560
Wei Rao's rightful husband.

44:46.240 --> 44:47.480
Then say it to me yourself.

44:49.080 --> 44:50.320
Say what?

44:50.400 --> 44:52.080
Say you need my protection.

44:52.600 --> 44:54.080
That you want to be my wife.

44:55.560 --> 44:59.000
You still need me
just as desperately as before.

45:00.480 --> 45:01.600
Of course I need you.

45:05.440 --> 45:08.000
Without you, I'll die.

45:36.400 --> 45:38.160
What should you call me?

45:44.120 --> 45:45.000
My dear.

46:01.360 --> 46:03.120
I'll move there with you.

46:15.880 --> 46:19.320
LV LUN, GOVERNESS CHANG'S HUSBAND

46:24.280 --> 46:25.240
My Lady.

46:30.920 --> 46:36.360
As for how Chang deceived me before,
I won't hold it against her anymore.

46:37.280 --> 46:38.360
From now on,

46:39.800 --> 46:41.360
you know what to do, don't you?

46:42.040 --> 46:44.800
Please have mercy, My Lady. Spare my life.

46:44.880 --> 46:46.600
From now on, whatever you command,

46:47.760 --> 46:49.680
I will obey.

47:04.480 --> 47:05.880
You may go.

47:08.920 --> 47:12.200
The Wei family sent men
to collect Governess Chang's coffin.

47:13.040 --> 47:15.320
I had some important instructions to give,

47:16.000 --> 47:17.840
so I came myself.

47:18.480 --> 47:20.040
While you were gone,

47:20.600 --> 47:23.360
Grandmother sat
in your courtyard every day,

47:23.440 --> 47:25.160
all day long.

47:25.680 --> 47:27.440
You should understand her position.

47:27.960 --> 47:30.240
She's not just your grandmother.

47:30.320 --> 47:32.520
She's also the head of the Wei family.

47:33.440 --> 47:37.240
If she truly loves me,
why would she side with outsiders?

47:38.080 --> 47:39.360
Aunt Yufeng,

47:39.440 --> 47:41.480
I don't care for empty words.

47:42.080 --> 47:45.280
I only want to know
what secret Governess Chang

47:45.960 --> 47:47.920
planned to tell my maternal grandmother.

47:50.560 --> 47:51.440
Well…

47:53.200 --> 47:55.080
What exactly did she say?

47:56.680 --> 47:58.040
She only said

47:59.320 --> 48:03.120
Aunt bribed the wet nurse
to abandon me on purpose.

48:04.600 --> 48:06.040
But I think she was lying.

48:06.640 --> 48:08.040
She must have been hiding something.

48:13.200 --> 48:14.400
Aunt Yufeng,

48:15.000 --> 48:18.720
please tell me exactly
what happened, word for word.

48:19.320 --> 48:20.720
What could there possibly be?

48:20.800 --> 48:24.960
She was just a greedy old woman
who stole money.

48:25.480 --> 48:27.280
How can you believe a word she said?

48:27.960 --> 48:29.640
Your aunt's heart toward you

48:29.720 --> 48:31.480
is a hundredfold truer than any pearl.

48:32.360 --> 48:35.040
You can doubt anyone, but never her.

48:35.720 --> 48:38.960
If she found out, she'd be heartbroken.

48:39.720 --> 48:42.760
Aunt Yufeng, don't dodge the question.

48:43.480 --> 48:46.760
Governess Chang
served the Wei family for years.

48:47.320 --> 48:49.840
She knew when to switch sides
and how to flatter those in power.

48:50.680 --> 48:54.920
Why would she flee for her life
over something as trivial as money?

48:55.880 --> 49:00.080
All she said was
that the wet nurse abandoned Rao.

49:00.640 --> 49:03.000
She never said what happened after that.

49:04.160 --> 49:06.200
A child vanished for an entire year.

49:06.720 --> 49:08.160
What could she have gone through?

49:08.720 --> 49:11.520
Why were the wet nurse and guards
ambushed and killed?

49:12.200 --> 49:13.960
Were they killed to silence them?

49:16.560 --> 49:18.520
-Unless the child they brought back was…
-Enough!

49:28.160 --> 49:32.040
Child, let me give you some advice.

49:33.600 --> 49:36.360
Stop digging into the distant past.

49:37.000 --> 49:39.880
Let the past stay buried.

49:40.800 --> 49:41.920
Digging any deeper…

49:43.960 --> 49:45.000
will do you

49:46.160 --> 49:48.240
no good at all.

49:48.840 --> 49:50.160
Do you understand?

49:56.760 --> 49:57.760
Good girl.

49:59.080 --> 50:02.000
Forget about Governess Chang.

50:02.720 --> 50:04.520
Pretend you never met her.

50:04.600 --> 50:06.520
Those questions in your heart,

50:07.760 --> 50:10.160
bury them deep inside.

50:11.280 --> 50:12.480
Forever.

50:13.320 --> 50:15.240
Never, ever ask them out loud.

50:18.000 --> 50:22.920
If anything troubles you,
go to your aunt for advice.

50:23.920 --> 50:27.120
Everyone in this world may hurt you.

50:29.080 --> 50:30.400
But she alone…

50:32.480 --> 50:34.720
will protect you.

53:01.840 --> 53:03.800
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
